     8415   end.
     8416    run fill-temp-cd in this-procedure ( input g#db-num, input 'маг':U, input i-obj-code, input yes).
     8417    if can-find(first temp-cd where
     8418                     temp-cd.obj-code = i-obj-code
     8419                AND  (temp-cd.pos-type = 'IBM-XML':U
     8420                     or
     8421                     temp-cd.pos-type = 'Autotank':U
     8422                     )
     8423                AND  temp-cd.db-num = g#db-num
     8424                ) then do:
