     9727       run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 3, input "ItemCountry" , input string( cash-gds.alpha1), input 1 ).
     9728     end.
     9729     else do:
     9730   find first buf_gds-obj-attr where buf_gds-obj-attr.gds-code = cash-gds.gds-code
