     9743       run gds-attr-value in this-procedure (
     9744                                    input cash-gds.gds-code
     9745                                   ,input 'ptrl-as-good':U
     9746                                   ,output v-attr-sale-trk
     9747                                   ,output v-attr-type) no-error.
