     9805       run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "ISNoTotalDisc" ,
     9806                                             input string(if cash-gds.wd > 0 then wd-option else 0), input 1 ).
     9807       run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "ISService" ,
     9808                                             input string(cash-gds.office), input 1 ).
     9809       find first ub.OperServ no-lock where ub.OperServ.gds-code = cash-gds.gds-code no-error .
