    12171             end.
    12172             put stream plucash unformatted                                                                               buf_cash-ncr-dis-kat.cd-subject-code                                                                         buf_cash-ncr-dis-kat.cd-disc-string                                                                          buf_cash-ncr-dis-kat.cd-subject-name                                                                         buf_cash-ncr-dis-kat.cd-other                                                                                skip.
    12173           end.
